{"sections":[{"id":"noi-dung","title":"Nội dung hướng dẫn","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-198276","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 1:","bold":true},{"text":" Fight alongside Battleon's Trainers to unravel a mysterious stranger's secrets, fend off rival cults, and save Lore from becoming a planet-sized ritual altar ("},{"text":"/join eldritchbattletown","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/eldritch-battletown"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-198472","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 2:","bold":true},{"text":" Evidence of ancient gods' power permeates Lore, influencing cities and towns. The whispers of Kathool and Dzeza blend with the scent of candy and chocolate ("},{"text":"/join eldritchworld","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/eldritch-world"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-198661","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 3:","bold":true},{"text":" In a world facing waves of madness caused by Kathool, a critical choice arises: sacrifice the world to save a friend or allow global insanity to prevail ("},{"text":"/join elodeatemple","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/elodea-temple"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-198847","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dw2V9D50LzQ"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sdqp78ce26s"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=67CL0xf9tXQ"},{"text":"\n"}]}]}],"previous":{"title":"Bocklin Grove Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/bocklin-grove-saga"},"missingImageCount":1}